s to be a paradise suspended in the air, perfect and untouchable\u2026 yet even the purest beauty can conceal shadows.\n\nEvery platform holds a secret, every encounter a revelation disguised as kindness. If you dare to look beyond the glow, you may find that what seems like a dream\u2026 might not be one at all.\n\nDreams can also become your prison.\n\nRelease notes: https://hushgame.co/release-notes", "short_description": "Welcome to Hush, a dreamlike world woven by the enigmatic Lumirios. Their radiant paradise floats in perfect beauty\u2026 yet even light can hide shadows. Each step may reveal secrets disguised as kindness, and what seems like a dream\u2026 might not be one at all..."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "7.png", "id": "4027125967504050", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821194_4027125980837382_8277190545024055400_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dWUHXSadnPcQ7kNvwFJjbau&_nc_oc=AdrzfOGdasSH8M34GQm46shY8hzKGInFvBGDzgEybOMbKlfR3eLtHGH674p2G3u_Zo0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-pZm_UsmCe6x6z2VqguY-7MTROAUOF5vTdaSUuaoZc0w&oe=6A3BE17B"}, {"file_name": "logo.png", "id": "1861368504501392", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820987_1861368507834725_6840608958467340636_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4d9bb-LRyYsQ7kNvwEs1sqd&_nc_oc=AdoaOyo_X0YzqVWRZmIUpbzl2DEVRJkOGIrFDai3Erpj2wryImgRJxJsXJq-R7U31z8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Sl1Dp0nLgjRYovpSOx-BkEiUz1cwEd_U7cd8oPWtN0A&oe=6A3BDC24"}, {"file_name": "hush.png", "id": "1164381762210810", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830146_1164381765544143_7273269185031902830_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eIKy5bHp-x8Q7kNvwELA3hg&_nc_oc=AdoamNJulbacl06vemnCcXuLgPHCT-CLnaMGSQBwhy74ixayiK4FfqwgvuApioINeUc&_nc_z